@port = 5121

@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### 1. Upload Image to Cloudinary (Requires Vendor JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/imageupload
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..P0KAOo_shyTlFSl6L90S0o82132DywROmeBW094YHO0
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cafe.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\Home\OneDrive\Desktop\cafe.jpg
--UploadBoundary--

### 2. Update Menu Item with the new Image URL
PUT {{host}}/api/menuitem/01a11005-b890-7e64-9899-048e90e4be4c
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..P0KAOo_shyTlFSl6L90S0o82132DywROmeBW094YHO0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Italian Pizza",
  "description": "The real taste of Italy, you will experience the authentic flavors of Italy in every bite.",
  "price": 1040.00,
  "category": "Pizza",
  "dietaryPreference": 0,
  "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkj8pecl6/image/upload/v1791532053/SwiftServe/njk5tejeadhyh8spp8rx.jpg"
}

### 2. Update Restaurant with the new Image URL
PUT {{host}}/api/restaurant/01a1109e-9460-7b5f-8197-524e4b58aeee
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..P0KAOo_shyTlFSl6L90S0o82132DywROmeBW094YHO0
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
  "name": "The Tulip Touche Cafe",
  "description":"Get your luxury right here",
  "fullAddress": "Alkapuri",
  "city":"Vadodara",
  "pinCode":"390009",
  "contactNumber":"9876543210",
  "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkj8pecl6/image/upload/v1791532265/SwiftServe/dknuglirjurbmdxvj5ax.jpg"
}